  "body": "* Total privacy\r\n* Minutes from the beach\r\n* Close to shops, schools, cafes\r\n* 4000m²+ of low-maintenance land\r\n* Room for pets, kids, boats\r\n* Huge double garage + carport\r\n* Multiple entertaining areas\r\n\r\nWelcome to 6 Chenery Road, Red Beach.\r\nPerhaps one of the most private properties in all of Red Beach.\r\nA home in a place that feels worlds away.\r\nYet so close to everything you need.\r\n\r\nWarm, bright, spacious and inviting.\r\nBrick and timber with long-run colour steel roofing.\r\nThree generous bedrooms, two bathrooms, a huge internal-access double garage, and multiple entertaining spaces inside and out.\r\nAll set on more than 4000m² of land and native bush.\r\n\r\nThe main lounge is big, bright and warmed with both a fireplace and Fujitsu heat pump, and there is also a ducted HRV system across the home. The lounge connects to the open-plan dining area and out to an expansive entertaining deck overlooking the beautiful native bush.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is open and flooded with natural light, with oodles of storage, Bosch appliances and tiled floors.\r\n\r\nAll three bedrooms are generous in size, with the master including a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. The main bathroom also features a built-in spa bath.\r\n\r\nThe established native bush, fruit trees, birdlife and fresh forest feeling really is something special. There is just so much space for kids, pets, countless places to explore and grow, plus the oversized garage for vehicles, tools, hobbies and storage. \r\n\r\nAnd it is all surprisingly low maintenance. \r\nNo big fields to mow. \r\nThere is also a legendary treehouse, standing tall with its own coat of arms.\r\n\r\n6 Chenery Road is a home that presents all the qualities of a lifestyle property but without the lifestyle commute. Close to shops, cafes, good schools, sports fields, beaches and public transport.\r\n\r\nCome and experience it while you can!\r\nJust in time for Summer.\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/J6ZN",
